{"type":"message","id":"e18cd816","parentId":"87fac572","timestamp":"2026-03-10T22:48:45.107Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:e1b719dc-47fb-45f7-b4b2-c36742813ce6 vault-sync] Sync the Obsidian vault: 1) cd ~/obsidian-vault && git add -A 2) If there are changes, commit with message including current timestamp (format: \"Vault auto-save $(date +'%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')\") 3) git push to https://github.com/TeraHertz2000/tera-vault. Report only if there were changes and the push succeeded.\nCurrent time: Tuesday, March 10th, 2026 — 10:48 PM (UTC) / 2026-03-10 22:48 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773182925103}}
{"type":"message","id":"1d474f23","parentId":"e18cd816","timestamp":"2026-03-10T22:48:50.039Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron job to sync the Obsidian vault. Let me execute the git commands to check for changes and push if there are any.","thinkingSignature":"2b607498b6d4e288fa3c0c873d2055c647bd1860576a46127db3d527375dcfe6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tp2xtlsl61xf_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/obsidian-vault && git add -A && git diff --staged --quiet"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.1","usage":{"input":32,"output":73,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":15267,"totalTokens":15372,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773182925105}}
